      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Have you had pain in your groin?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:16",
      "end_timestamp": "01:19",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Yeah. One week, I'd say. As for pain in my groin, pretty mild, if I'm being honest. The not being able to stand? That's been for about a month.",
